{"id":"f1f5870a469a5e14","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md","title":"Weak Measurability","display":"df-weak-measurability — Weak Measurability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weak-measurability","aliases":["58-df-weak-measurability","Weak Measurability"],"display":"df-weak-measurability — Weak Measurability","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weak-measurability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weak-measurability</span><span>Weak Measurability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-measurability — Weak Measurability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,f,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,f,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}measurability}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land X^*\\subseteq\\{\\ell\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,X,\\mathbb K)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\ell\\in X^*\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\ell\\circ f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}measurability}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land X^*\\subseteq\\{\\ell\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,X,\\mathbb K)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\ell\\in X^*\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\ell\\circ f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The dual family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> and scalar Borel sigma-algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\\)</span> are explicit parameters; continuity or linearity of the members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> belongs to the supplied dual-space construction.</li>\n<li>Weak measurability means that every scalar projection is measurable from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> to the Borel measurable field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K\">\\(\\mathbb K\\)</span>; no Lebesgue measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> is required by the definition.</li>\n<li>Strong measurability: approximation by simple functions; equals Bochner measurability</li>\n<li>Pettis measurability theorem: strong = weak + almost separably valued</li>\n<li>Progressively measurable: adapted to filtration; used in stochastic integration</li>\n<li>Lusin's theorem fails in infinite dimensions; need stronger notions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diestel and Uhl, Vector Measures</li>\n<li>Yosida, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Cohn, Measure Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2$ and $\\mathrm{Measurable}_S$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,f,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}measurability}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{WeaklyMeasurable}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,X,X^*,\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\n\\land\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Omega,X)\\\\\n&\\land X^*\\subseteq\\{\\ell\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,X,\\mathbb K)\\}\n\\land\\forall\\ell\\in X^*\\;\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\ell\\circ f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb K,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K})).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb K}","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb K","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false}],"bytes":2157,"backlinks":[{"id":"0a75c1a17d157e95","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-weak-measurability.md|58-df-weak-measurability]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["bbbec05fde1d3b01","a740bdad87b97ac6","36d7463d215be751"]}